# Playwright reviewer screenshots — chunk reviewers use Playwright MCP
# `browser_take_screenshot` which ignores the filename param and writes
# `m5r-*.png` / `m6r-*.png` to repo root, polluting `git status`. Both M5
# and M6 reviewers have hit this. See .claude/IDEAS.md M6 chunk 3 reviewer
# P2-1.
m5r-*.png
m6r-*.png

